Rule 2 (Input tensor A must be square matrix or a batch of square matrices)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1)
